{"title":"2001 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If for three distinct positive numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/699fbbff2c70d9bcc266368e9aea9ea16aa1c488.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{y}{x+z} = \\frac{x+y}{z} = \\frac{x}{y}\\]\" width=\"151\" height=\"39\" />Then find the numerical value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/2/e32f96b310bbe6cd6981b6c1da83fe7905ea3116.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"12\" height=\"36\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the first equality yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/e/94e77d9628d44c3990c7bc3f4f409a69b2439a4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$yz=(x+y)(x+z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"157\" height=\"20\" />; thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/f/66f87c7f11af193cf93a8a3f00f80a173aee6af9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x+y+z)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" /> after expanding. We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0d65928fe9419ace24a6a6563f0e637fddfc2a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\ne0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/8/948bef8fd29dd497dd9532936d11a5bdb999ded4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+z=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/1/411dfec37f2437b790e9423753775cc6f814ffdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=-z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/b/3fb15d445fec900a96c969b3df667a304b6197c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+y}{z} = \\frac{-z}{z}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"37\" />; this is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/2/e32f96b310bbe6cd6981b6c1da83fe7905ea3116.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"12\" height=\"36\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/e/daec179497cfd3783053df35f71d9de3fcd325c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}=\\boxed{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"75\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Eevee9406\">eevee9406</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017195530\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 54/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2360/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:31298:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017195530 and revision id 245503. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}